    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Easy Architect</strong> lets you visually build custom post types, meta fields, and dynamic templates—right in the WordPress admin, no coding needed.<br />\nIts intuitive interface makes it easy to organize content, connect meta fields to any block, and design flexible templates in the block editor.<br />\nAdvanced blocks like Easy Icon and Easy Date &amp; Time provide unique controls for dynamic layouts and smart formatting.<br />\nDrag-and-drop meta field ordering, visual indicators, and automatic hiding of empty fields keep your templates clean and adaptable.<br />\nWhether for a movie database, portfolio, or any custom content, Easy Architect gives you powerful, code-free control over your site’s structure and display.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />\n* Visual creation and management of custom post types and meta fields<br />\n* Dynamic template building with the block editor—no PHP required<br />\n* Universal meta field connections: bind any block to meta fields, with real-time sync and visual indicators<br />\n* Advanced Easy Icon block: morph icons with curvature, repeat, partial fill, and color controls<br />\n* Easy Date &amp; Time block: flexible formatting, relative time, and meta field binding<br />\n* Drag &amp; drop meta field ordering and intuitive admin UI<br />\n* Enhanced Group block: hide groups if meta fields are empty for dynamic layouts<br />\n* Full compatibility with WordPress core blocks and block bindings<br />\n* Clean, minimal, and fast—feels like a native part of WordPress</p>\n<h3>Workflow Example</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Create a Post Type</strong> (e.g., &#8220;Movie&#8221;) in the admin.</li>\n<li><strong>Add Meta Fields</strong> (e.g., &#8220;Director&#8221;, &#8220;Release Date&#8221;, &#8220;Rating&#8221;) via the Meta submenu.</li>\n<li><strong>Design a Template</strong> in the block editor:\n<ul>\n<li>Insert Easy Icon blocks for ratings, Easy Date &amp; Time for release dates, and connect Paragraph/Heading blocks to meta fields.</li>\n<li>Use the Group block’s &#8220;Hide if Meta is empty&#8221; option for dynamic sections.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Edit Content</strong>: Fill in meta fields in the sidebar or directly in the editor.</li>\n<li><strong>Frontend</strong>: Your template displays only the fields with content, keeping layouts clean and dynamic.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20meta%20fields%20in%20the%20block%20editor%3F'>\nCan I use meta fields in the block editor?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! All registered meta fields are available in the block editor and can be bound to core blocks or Easy blocks.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20does%20the%20curvature%20system%20work%20in%20easy%20icon%3F'>\nHow does the curvature system work in Easy Icon?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The curvature slider morphs icons from geometric to organic shapes, giving you infinite design options from a single icon.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Meta field input cursor no longer jumps to end position during typing in sidebar plugin</li>\n<li>Enhanced: Connection toolbar button now shows red error state when meta field connections are broken</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Meta fields now display in correct position order in sidebar</li>\n<li>Fixed: Image block properly shows connected meta field label in connection status</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhanced: Developer-friendly meta connection system &#8211; blocks can now opt into meta field connections via block.json configuration</li>\n<li>Improved: Cleaner, more maintainable codebase with better documentation and component organization</li>\n<li>Fixed: Various UI improvements and connection stability enhancements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>NEW: Easy Icon block with advanced curvature transformation and dynamic features and meta field integration</li>\n<li>NEW: Easy Date &amp; Time block with intelligent formatting and meta field integration</li>\n<li>NEW: Easy Number block with calculator and meta field integration</li>\n<li>NEW: Easy Image block with meta field integration</li>\n<li>NEW: Meta field connection system for WordPress core blocks like paragraph and header</li>\n<li>Enhanced: Visual connection indicators, real-time sync, and improved UI</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Visually build custom post types, meta fields, and dynamic templates—no code. Advanced block editor integration and dynamic icons.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Easy Architect</strong> lets you visually build custom post types, meta fields, and dynamic templates—right in the WordPress admin, no coding needed.<br />\nIts intuitive interface makes it easy to organize content, connect meta fields to any block, and design flexible templates in the block editor.<br />\nAdvanced blocks like Easy Icon and Easy Date &amp; Time provide unique controls for dynamic layouts and smart formatting.<br />\nDrag-and-drop meta field ordering, visual indicators, and automatic hiding of empty fields keep your templates clean and adaptable.<br />\nWhether for a movie database, portfolio, or any custom content, Easy Architect gives you powerful, code-free control over your site’s structure and display.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />\n* Visual creation and management of custom post types and meta fields<br />\n* Dynamic template building with the block editor—no PHP required<br />\n* Universal meta field connections: bind any block to meta fields, with real-time sync and visual indicators<br />\n* Advanced Easy Icon block: morph icons with curvature, repeat, partial fill, and color controls<br />\n* Easy Date &amp; Time block: flexible formatting, relative time, and meta field binding<br />\n* Drag &amp; drop meta field ordering and intuitive admin UI<br />\n* Enhanced Group block: hide groups if meta fields are empty for dynamic layouts<br />\n* Full compatibility with WordPress core blocks and block bindings<br />\n* Clean, minimal, and fast—feels like a native part of WordPress</p>\n<h3>Workflow Example</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Create a Post Type</strong> (e.g., &#8220;Movie&#8221;) in the admin.</li>\n<li><strong>Add Meta Fields</strong> (e.g., &#8220;Director&#8221;, &#8220;Release Date&#8221;, &#8220;Rating&#8221;) via the Meta submenu.</li>\n<li><strong>Design a Template</strong> in the block editor:\n<ul>\n<li>Insert Easy Icon blocks for ratings, Easy Date &amp; Time for release dates, and connect Paragraph/Heading blocks to meta fields.</li>\n<li>Use the Group block’s &#8220;Hide if Meta is empty&#8221; option for dynamic sections.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Edit Content</strong>: Fill in meta fields in the sidebar or directly in the editor.</li>\n<li><strong>Frontend</strong>: Your template displays only the fields with content, keeping layouts clean and dynamic.</li>\n</ol>\n",
